WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.674
Laamu gande Obiré. Ɗuum ko haala taariika, ɗum laaɓɓi ngam hollaago.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.144
Haa Obiré, nder worgo hirnaange Burkina, laamu gan ɗon haalde diga duuɓi.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.474
Laamiiɗo mawɗo jaɓii nder suudu muuɗum. En njooɗi yeeso maako.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.256
Laamiiɗo mawɗo, min ɗon njaɓana'on barka.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.064
On njaaraama haa wuro am.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.522
Ammaa laamiiɗo ɗon nyaama. O marɗo, yimɓe fuu ɗon ndaara mo.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.586
Wakkati go'oto nder jemma, ɓe mbi'i: Laamiiɗo maayi.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.968
Yimɓe ɗon mbi'a ɗum nder ɓooyi, yimɓe boo ɗon kawndi.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.760
Yimɓe ɗon njaha laawol ngol yaasi leɗɗe, to yenaande laamiiɓe.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.536
Onon maama'en, go'oto nder mooɗon ɗon wondi bee mooɗon.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:00.752
Haa ɗo laamiiɓe ɓaawo'en ɗon ɗaɓɓita ummaatooje maɓɓe.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.866
Laamiiɗo ɗon jooɗoto. Kawtal mawɓe ɗon kawta.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.292
Ɗuum woni ko'e maɓɓe. Yimɓe ardiiɓe ɗon ndarii. Moye laamiiɗo keso?

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.792
Gooto laamiiɗo suɓii.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:02.482
Eɗen njaara mo haa woɓɓe. Laamiiɗo mo'o warata ɗon nyiɓɓa nder ɓernde, haa yimɓe ndaarataa.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:10.240
Nder jemma nder lekki, yimɓe ɗon mbi'a maama'en njahi to maako.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:36.418
Nyalnde laamiiɗo ɗon wara. Laamu laamiiɗo ɗon maɓɓito dow laamu kesum.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.608
Yimɓe nder leydi ndin ɗon mbi'a bee dokke e nyaamdu ɗi ɓe ngalaa.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.560
Haa hande, laamu gan ɗon tokki Obiré.
